GET http://localhost:4004/admin/Adoptions
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=

### Admin tries to create an adoption (should be rejected)
POST http://localhost:4004/admin/Adoptions
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=
Content-Type: application/json

